WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.342
Nobody has been more than a few
kilometres down.

00:00:03.792 --> 00:00:09.770
The deepest hole ever drilled, the
Kola borehole in the Russian Arctic,

00:00:09.770 --> 00:00:11.791
reached 12.3 km in 1989.

00:00:12.241 --> 00:00:15.248
That is about a five-hundredth of the
way to the centre.

00:00:15.698 --> 00:00:19.151
Everything below it we know from
earthquakes: their waves cross the

00:00:19.151 --> 00:00:22.501
planet, and the time they take tells
us what they passed through.
